/E (We are excited to partner with you for Hacktech 2027. We host a 36-hour hackathon, a competition where students collaborate and create software projects to solve real-world problems. Our event is made possible through your support and belief in our mission: to showcase and champion the next generation of engineers and innovators. Together, we enable an exciting event filled with energy that catalyzes this process. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
